f. keep the Corresponding Source available for as long as the distributed form
   remains available and for at least three years after the last distribution;

g. license the entire Modified Work under this same License, with no additional
   restriction that conflicts with it;

h. ensure that every recipient can exercise the same Non-Commercial Use,
